All code in this repository is original, except:

1. kit/ — dgx-spark-recipe-kit (BHCC2025, Apache-2.0), vendored at a tagged release via git subtree.
2. bench/ and scripts/smoke-test.sh — shared with the other BHCC2025 recipe repos (same authors, same licence).

This repository contains no model weights. ./setup.sh downloads, from Hugging Face:
- nvidia/Gemma-4-31B-IT-NVFP4 (NVIDIA's NVFP4 quantization of Google's Gemma 4 31B IT)
- google/gemma-4-31B-it-assistant (Google's speculative-decoding draft model)
Both are distributed under the Gemma terms of use, which you accept on Hugging Face before downloading.

Container image: vllm/vllm-openai (vLLM project, Apache-2.0), used unmodified.
